.SH "NAME"
ukui-input-gather-test \- The ukui-input-gather client demo.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B ukui-input-gather-test
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
ukui-input-gather-test is ukui-input-gather client demo.
This program provides several commands for interactions with the program.
.TP
\fB --help\fR
Help info.
.TP
\fB --connectServer\fR
Show info for connect.
.TP
\fB --debug-events\fR
Show info for events.
.TP
\fB --call\fR
Call method request.
